OL,3,GNEWSA'Oasis gigs prove Knebworth is
OL,4,Aworld's best venue'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of Knebworth House declared
OL,7,Fit the "greatest music venue in the
OL,8,Fworld" after Oasis announced their
OL,9,Freturn.
OL,11,FThe band will be back at the
OL,12,FHertfordshire stately home, scene of
OL,13,Ftheir legendary 1996 gigs, to play four
OL,14,Fnights in September 2027.
OL,16,FEstate owner Henry Lytton Cobbold said
OL,17,Fhe was "thrilled to bits" after hearing
OL,18,Fvia social media that Liam and Noel
OL,19,FGallagher had confirmed the band's
OL,20,Fcomeback.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
